# Every byte in this repo is load-bearing: the .cmd artifacts (and the woven kernels) are
# CRLF-critical (cmd label lookup needs CR), the sh sources are LF, and several files carry
# literal control bytes (0x01/0x02/0x07/0x08 sentinels). Disable ALL git eol/text conversion
# so a clone with core.autocrlf=true (the Windows default) can never mangle them.
* -text
